#: app/kateconfigdialog.cpp:65
msgid "Configure Kate"
msgstr "Çawdêrîya Kate"

#: app/kateconfigdialog.cpp:90 app/kateconfigdialog.cpp:96
#: app/kateconfigdialog.cpp:197 app/kateconfigdialog.cpp:205
#: app/kateconfigdialog.cpp:252
msgid "Application"
msgstr "Applikation"

#: app/kateconfigdialog.cpp:96
msgid "General"
msgstr "General"

#: app/kateconfigdialog.cpp:97
msgid "General Options"
msgstr "Sazkirina General"

#: app/kateconfigdialog.cpp:104
msgid "Startup"
msgstr "Programstart"

#: app/kateconfigdialog.cpp:108
msgid "Reopen &files at startup"
msgstr "Jinivre vekkirina&faîlan li Programmstartê"

#: app/kateconfigdialog.cpp:112
msgid ""
"If this is enabled Kate will attempt to reopen files that were open when you "
"closed last time. Cursor position will be recovered if possible. "
"Non-existent files will not be opened."
msgstr ""
"Heger ev danan aktiv be, wê Kate wan faîla bixwaze vekke , jên ku di dema paşî de çaxa "
"ew vekkirî bûn vekke. ligel wê jî wê Positiona Cursor ja berê nîşan bide. "
"Ew faîlên nemayî serê xwe têde na êşîni û lê na gerri."

#: app/kateconfigdialog.cpp:119
msgid "Restore &view configuration"
msgstr "Çawdêrî yê dîmenê &restore bike"

#: app/kateconfigdialog.cpp:122
msgid ""
"Check this if you want all your views and frames restored each time you open "
"Kate"
msgstr ""
"Evê Dananê Aktiv bike, heger tu bixwaze, ku her dîmen(view) û frame yên cara "
"çûwî di destpêka Kate bêne disa nîşandin."

#: app/kateconfigdialog.cpp:127
msgid "Allow Kate to use more than one UN&IX process"
msgstr "Destûrê bide Kate, pirter ji yek Un&IX-Process bi kar bîne"

#: app/kateconfigdialog.cpp:131
msgid ""
"If this is unchecked, Kate will only use one UNIX process. If you try "
"running it again, the current process will get the focus, and open any files "
"you requested to be opened. If it is checked, each time you start Kate, a "
"new UNIX process will be started."
msgstr ""
"Heger ev Option bêkar bibe, wê Kate bitenê yek Unix-Process bi kar "
"bîne. heger te xwest, wê carekdin start bike, wê bi tenê current process "
"focus wergiri, û faîlekê vekke ji wanê te xwestî. Lê heger ev Option bête bi "
"karkirin, wê bi her startek ji Kate processeke nûh vebbi."

#: app/kateconfigdialog.cpp:137
msgid "Show full &path in title"
msgstr "Nîşankirina &Rîka giştî di lista Serdêr"

#: app/kateconfigdialog.cpp:140
msgid ""
"If this option is checked, the full document path will be shown in the "
"window caption."
msgstr ""
"Heger ev Option bê bi karînan wê rêka giştî ya faîla vekkirî di lista "
"Serdêr bête nîşankirin."

#: app/kateconfigdialog.cpp:145
msgid "&Show content when resizing views"
msgstr "nîşandana &content di dema gûhertinên gewre"

#: app/kateconfigdialog.cpp:148
msgid ""
"If this is disabled, resizing views will display a <i>rubberband</i>"
" to show the new sizes untill you release the mouse button."
msgstr ""
"Heger ev danan deaktiv be, wê di kata gûhertinên gewre yek "
"<i>rubberband</i> bvête nîşkirin, hetta tu tasta mişk berde."

#: app/kateconfigdialog.cpp:154
msgid "Sync &terminal emulator with active document"
msgstr "&Konzole di Dokumenta aktîv bîne wehhevî"

#: app/kateconfigdialog.cpp:157
msgid ""
"If this is checked, the built in Konsole will <code>cd</code> to the "
"directory of the active document when started and whenever the active "
"document changes, if the document is a local file."
msgstr ""
"Heger ev danan hate hilbijartin, wê ew konzola hatîye avakirin jiber xwe ve bigûhere "
"di wê doseyê de ya ku dokumenta aktîv jê hatîye, lê heger ev dokument ji "
"Komputerê te be."

#: app/kateconfigdialog.cpp:164
msgid "&Number of recent files:"
msgstr "&Jimêra faîlên hatibûn vekirî:"

#: app/kateconfigdialog.cpp:169
msgid ""
"<qt>Sets the number of recent files remembered by Kate."
"<p><strong>NOTE: </strong>If you set this lower than the current value, the "
"list will be truncated and some items forgotten.</qt>"
msgstr ""
"<qt>Jimara faîlên ne ji demek dûr vekkirî bûn sazdike, yên ku Kate di Menu "
"\"faîl\" nîşan dide.<p><strong>ha jê hebe: </strong>heger tu nirxê kêm "
"bike, wê list bête jêkirin û hinek Element wê wund bibin.</qt>"

#: app/kateconfigdialog.cpp:178
msgid "Toolview mode:"
msgstr "Toolview-Mod:"

#: app/kateconfigdialog.cpp:180
msgid "Modern Style"
msgstr "Stîla Modern"

#: app/kateconfigdialog.cpp:181
msgid "Classic Style"
msgstr "Stîla klassîk"

#: app/kateconfigdialog.cpp:183
msgid ""
"Choose how you want the toolviews managed."
"<BR>"
"<ul>"
"<li><b>Modern Style</b> The toolviews will behave similiar to the views in "
"Konqueror's navigation panel.</li>"
"<li><b>Classic Style</b> The toolviews (filelist, fileselector, ...) can be "
"docked anywhere and made floating.</li></ul>"
msgstr ""
"li vir hilbijêre, çawa toolview kar bike."
"<BR>"
"<ul>"
"<li><b>stîla modern</b> Ew Toolview wê mîna navigation panel di "
"Konqueror tprogramme werden ähnlich wie der bête arrangkirin.</li>"
"<li><b>stîla klassîkî</b> Ew Toolviews (lista faîlan,....) karin têkevin "
"her cihî de ew milan bikin li her cihî.</li></ul>"

#: app/kateconfigdialog.cpp:197
msgid "File Selector"
msgstr "Faîl hilbijêr"

#: app/kateconfigdialog.cpp:199
msgid "File Selector Settings"
msgstr "Danana faîl hilbijêr"

