#: app/kateconfigplugindialogpage.cpp:146
msgid "License"
msgstr "Lîsens"

#: app/kateconfigplugindialogpage.cpp:147
msgid ""
"Here you can see all available Kate plugins. Those with a check mark are "
"loaded, and will be loaded again the next time Kate is started."
msgstr ""
"Li vir tu kari her Kate plugins bibîne. ewê xêzkirî ew hatine loadkirin "
"wê ligel startkirin bê ya Kate aktîv bibin."

#: app/katefileselector.cpp:152
msgid "Bookmarks"
msgstr "Bookmarks"

#: app/katefileselector.cpp:171
msgid "Current Document Directory"
msgstr "Dosêya current Dokument"

#: app/katefileselector.cpp:198
msgid ""
"<p>Here you can enter a path for a directory to display."
"<p>"
"To go to a directory previously entered, press the arrow on the right end "
"and choose one."
"<p>The entry has directory completion. Right-click to choose how completion "
"should behave."
msgstr ""
"<p>livir tu kari rêkê deîne ji dosêkê re jibo bête nîşankirin."
"<p>"
"jibo ku tu rêkek kevin ya te bi kar anîye bi kar bîne, pêl tîrka li "
"çep ke û faîlekî hilbijêre."
"<p>Ev entry kompletkirina automatîk heye. Pêl tasta mişk ya çeppê ke ji bo tu deîna "
"kompletkirin çawa  berdewam bike."

#: app/katefileselector.cpp:202
msgid ""
"<p>Here you can enter a name filter to limit which files are displayed."
"<p>To clear the filter, toggle off the filter button to the left."
"<p>To reapply the last filter used, toggle on the filter button."
msgstr ""
"<p>Li vir tu kari filterekê ji navê faîlan deîne, jibo ku ew faîlên bêtin nîşankirin "
"ti limît bike.<p>Heger tu filterê bi xwaze vemmirîne, ew mişkoka li alîyê çepê wê "
"alîkarîya te bike."
"<p>ji bo ku tu Filtera dawî hatibu bikarkirin dîsa bikarbîne, li mişkoka filterê xe"

#: app/katefileselector.cpp:206
msgid ""
"<p>This button clears the name filter when toggled off, or reapplies the "
"last filter used when toggled on."
msgstr ""
"<p>Ev miîkok filtera navê faîlan diavêje der. Bi karanîna jinivre, "
"wê filtera dawî hatibu bi karkirin bête bikarînan."

#: app/katefileselector.cpp:316
msgid "Apply Last Filter (\"%1\")"
msgstr "Filtera berê bikarbîne (\"%1\")"

#: app/katefileselector.cpp:321
msgid "Clear Filter"
msgstr "Filter bikuje"

