msgid "Session"
msgstr "Session"

#: app/katefileselector.cpp:539
msgid "Restore loca&tion"
msgstr "Restore kirina &Rêkdanan u navnîşanan"

#: app/katefileselector.cpp:540
msgid "Restore last f&ilter"
msgstr "Restore kirina Filterê &Paşî"

#: app/katefileselector.cpp:558
msgid ""
"<p>Decides how many locations to keep in the history of the location combo "
"box"
msgstr "<p>saz dike, çend navnîşanên serhildanên berê jibona lista hilbijartinê bête tomarkirin."

#: app/katefileselector.cpp:562
msgid "<p>Decides how many filters to keep in the history of the filter combo box"
msgstr "<p>saz dike, çend ji wan filterên yên hatibun karînan bêne tomarkirin"

#: app/katefileselector.cpp:566
msgid ""
"<p>These options allow you to have the File Selector automatically change "
"location to the directory of the active document on certain events."
"<p>Auto synchronization is <em>lazy</em>, meaning it will not take effect "
"until the file selector is visible."
"<p>None of these are enabled by default, but you can always sync the "
"location by pressing the sync button in the toolbar."
msgstr ""
"<p>Ev Option saz dike, ku kengî divê bête biguhre ser Doseyên, ya ku neha(êsta) Dokumenta aktiv "
"tê deye.<p>Sychronizationa Automatik ya \"Sersar\", yanî wê guhertin wê çaxê çê bibe, dema ku "
"hilbijêrê faîl bête xuya kirin. <p>u ne yek Option ji ber xwe ve pêketîye. tu kari Synchroniization "
"bi destê xwe çêbike, heger tu pê li mişkoka nukirinê ya di seko de bike."

#: app/katefileselector.cpp:574
msgid ""
"<p>If this option is enabled (default), the location will be restored when "
"you start Kate."
"<p><strong>Note</strong> that if the session is handled by the KDE session "
"manager, the location is always restored."
msgstr ""
"<p>Heger ev option pêkettî be (ew bi xwe ji Standard wissa ye), "
"wê ew navnîşana ya tu paşî li ser bu bixwe vebbe, dema ku tu Kate start bike."
"<p><strong>Agehdarî</strong>: Heger session ya te KDE-Manager bi kar tîne wê "
"evaya automatik bête pêxistin heger te wê saz jî neke."

#: app/katefileselector.cpp:578
msgid ""
"<p>If this option is enabled (default), the current filter will be restored "
"when you start Kate."
"<p><strong>Note</strong> that if the session is handled by the KDE session "
"manager, the filter is always restored."
"<p><strong>Note</strong>"
" that some of the autosync settings may override the restored location if on."
msgstr ""
"<p>Heger ev option pêkettî be (ew bi xwe ji Standard wissa ye), "
"wê ew Filtera ya tu paşî li ser bu jiberxwe ve pêkeve, dema ku tu Kate start bike."
"<p><strong>Agehdarî</strong>: Heger session ya te KDE-Manager bi kar tîne wê "
"evaya(Filterê paşî hate bi karînan) jiberxwe ve bête pêxistin û heger te wê saz jî neke."
"<p><strong>ji pêvî wê jî agehdar be</strong>: hinek dananên autosync belkî "
"li navnîşanên çuwî careka dî binîvise."

